        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">What is a Payment Link?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">A payment link is a shareable checkout page attached to one or more saved products and prices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Use a Payment Link When</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">The offer and price are already set, several buyers may purchase the same offer, the buyer does not need a custom invoice first, you want to place the link in email, message, QR code, button, or social post.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Quick Comparison -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-amber-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-amber-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Quick Comparison</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Product</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Stores what you sell and how it is priced. Example: 90-Minute Strategy Session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Invoice</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Requests payment from one named client. Example: Invoice Amy for a custom consulting session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Payment Link</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Gives buyers a reusable checkout. Example: Share a link for a workshop ticket.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Products store what you sell. Invoices request payment from named clients. Payment links provide reusable checkout pages. Choose the right tool for each situation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Prepare the Account and Plan the Sale</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Identify Your Offers</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write down 2-3 things you currently sell or plan to sell.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Choose the Right Tool</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">For each offer, decide: Is it a product? Would you use an invoice or payment link to sell it?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Write Down One Real Offer</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Choose one offer you will use throughout this module.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'The Three Payment Tools',
      lesson_number = 1,
      sort_order = 1,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: The Three Payment Tools';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: The Three Payment Tools

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 11 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 11 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'three-payment-tools' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson three-payment-tools not found in module 11';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the main job of a product in LeadProspectrr?', 
    '["It stores what you sell and how it is priced","It automatically collects payments from customers","It sends invoices to all your contacts","It creates payment links automatically"]'::jsonb,
    'It stores what you sell and how it is priced',
    'A product stores the name, description, price, and payment type for something you sell. It does not collect payment by itself—it must be offered through invoices, payment links, or other checkout methods.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'When should you use an invoice instead of a payment link?', 
    '["When you want to share the same offer with many buyers","When the buyer is already known and the amount is specific to that client","When you want to post on social media","When you do not know who the buyer is"]'::jsonb,
    'When the buyer is already known and the amount is specific to that client',
    'Use an invoice when the buyer is known, the amount or scope is client-specific, they need a formal record, or payment is due by a specific date.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is a payment link best used for?', 
    '["Sending custom billing records to one client","Creating a shareable checkout page for a fixed offer that many buyers can purchase","Storing product descriptions only","Tracking overdue payments"]'::jsonb,
    'Creating a shareable checkout page for a fixed offer that many buyers can purchase',
    'A payment link creates a reusable checkout page for a fixed offer. It is ideal when several buyers may purchase the same thing and you want to share the link via email, social media, QR codes, or buttons.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
